This directory contains a MODIFIED build of Play! (jpd002/Play-).

Modifications: PlayStation 2 multitap emulation, enabling up to 8 controllers.
See docs/ps2-multitap/ for the full patch set. Source for the modified build:
branch `multitap`, based on upstream commit 50aedca2639521bc498ace0b2be1ea012801a86a.

The unmodified upstream build is shipped separately in ../play/.

